  "id": "32341391",
  "title": "习近平春节前夕赴山西看望慰问基层干部群众",
  "date": "2022-01-27 13:00:06",
  "author": "人民日报客户端",
  "editor": "(责编：王潇潇                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<script src=\"http://tv.people.com.cn/img/player/v.js\"></script><script>showPlayer({id:\"/pvservice/xml/2022/1/27/c306ac51-dc0c-4d1d-ae0f-2d707e8a7426.xml\",width:600,height:371,autoplay:false});</script></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n春节前夕，习近平总书记赴山西考察调研。26日下午，他先后来到霍州市师庄乡冯南垣村、汾西县僧念镇段村，走进村民家中看望，实地了解山西灾后恢复重建、秋冬补种、确保群众安全温暖过冬，以及巩固拓展脱贫攻坚成果、接续推进乡村振兴等情况。（文字：人民日报记者杜尚泽；摄影：新华社记者 李学仁 谢环驰 燕雁 丁海涛）</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271248000303405548775.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 500px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271248000362726869409.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 508px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271248000426010266202.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 580px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271248000491505665192.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 533px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000022995713114.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 539px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000082492770955.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 611px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000156575759292.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 533px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000215406966010.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 549px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000303676148564.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 491px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000354128970293.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 634px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000415333065826.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 533px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000473644005534.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 533px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000530583976524.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 480px;\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2022/0127/MAIN202201271249000590513075081.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 533px;\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "春节前夕，习近平总书记赴山西考察调研。26日下午，他先后来到霍州市师庄乡冯南垣村、汾西县僧念镇段村，走进村民家中看望，实地了解山西灾后恢复重建、秋冬补种、确保群众安全温暖过冬，以及巩固拓展脱贫攻坚成果、接续推进乡村振兴等情况。（文字：人民日报记者杜尚泽；摄影：新华社记者 李学仁 谢环驰 燕雁 丁海涛）"
  ]
}
